{"id":"wb-7-749","name":"保定钟楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"保定钟楼","text":"保定钟楼，又名鸣霜楼，曾名宣德楼、干云楼，是中国河北省保定市的钟楼。保定钟楼或不晚于金朝修建并于明宣德年间（1426年-1435年）重建，或修建于明宣德年间。为重檐歇山布瓦顶的建筑，内悬挂金朝大定二十一年（1181年）所铸铁钟一口。钟楼建成后多次修缮，为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BF%9D%E5%AE%9A%E9%92%9F%E6%A5%BC","revisionId":93118622,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93118622","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d1f7af7ddb6042b0e204144d.jpg","title":"保定钟楼_南侧.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BF%9D%E5%AE%9A%E9%92%9F%E6%A5%BC_%E5%8D%97%E4%BE%A7.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%AE%9A%E9%92%9F%E6%A5%BC_%E5%8D%97%E4%BE%A7.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​保定钟楼 南侧","width":320,"height":240}}